@* Integrations — every connector as a card, one search over all of them. The grid is
   static cards linking to per-connector setup routes; the search is a GET form so a query
   like ?q=slack is a shareable URL. Brand marks are flat color tiles with a letter — Lucide
   ships no brand glyphs, and a tile never 404s the way a hotlinked logo does. The API strip
   at the bottom is a real CodeBlock, so the snippet copies exactly what the docs show. *@

<div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-5xl">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-2xl text-center">
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-balance">Connect your stack</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 text-muted-foreground">Forty-one connectors, one API. Search, pick, authorize — no OAuth code on your side.</p>
        <form method="get" action="/integrations" up-target="[data-connectors]" up-autosubmit class="mx-auto mt-6 max-w-md">
            <Input Type="search" name="q" placeholder="Search connectors…" aria-label="Search connectors" />
        </form>
    </div>

    <div data-connectors class="mt-10 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
        <a href="/integrations/slack" class="rounded-xl border p-5 transition hover:border-foreground/30 hover:shadow-sm">
            <span class="flex size-10 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-[#4a154b] text-base font-bold text-white">S</span>
            <p class="mt-4 font-semibold">Slack</p>
            <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-muted-foreground">Pipe flag changes and approvals into any channel.</p>
            <p class="num mt-3 text-xs text-muted-foreground">Chat</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/integrations/github" class="rounded-xl border p-5 transition hover:border-foreground/30 hover:shadow-sm">
            <span class="flex size-10 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-foreground text-base font-bold text-background">G</span>
            <p class="mt-4 font-semibold">GitHub</p>
            <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-muted-foreground">Gate merges on flag state with status checks.</p>
            <p class="num mt-3 text-xs text-muted-foreground">DevOps</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/integrations/stripe" class="rounded-xl border p-5 transition hover:border-foreground/30 hover:shadow-sm">
            <span class="flex size-10 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-[#635bff] text-base font-bold text-white">S</span>
            <p class="mt-4 font-semibold">Stripe</p>
            <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-muted-foreground">Tie entitlements to plans without custom code.</p>
            <p class="num mt-3 text-xs text-muted-foreground">Billing</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/integrations/datadog" class="rounded-xl border p-5 transition hover:border-foreground/30 hover:shadow-sm">
            <span class="flex size-10 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-[#632ca6] text-base font-bold text-white">D</span>
            <p class="mt-4 font-semibold">Datadog</p>
            <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-muted-foreground">Halt rollouts automatically on monitor alerts.</p>
            <p class="num mt-3 text-xs text-muted-foreground">Observability</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/integrations/salesforce" class="rounded-xl border p-5 transition hover:border-foreground/30 hover:shadow-sm">
            <span class="flex size-10 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-[#00a1e0] text-base font-bold text-white">S</span>
            <p class="mt-4 font-semibold">Salesforce</p>
            <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-muted-foreground">Sync entitlements down to the account record.</p>
            <p class="num mt-3 text-xs text-muted-foreground">CRM</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/integrations/webhook" class="rounded-xl border p-5 transition hover:border-foreground/30 hover:shadow-sm">
            <span class="flex size-10 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-muted text-base font-bold text-foreground">W</span>
            <p class="mt-4 font-semibold">Webhooks</p>
            <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-muted-foreground">Everything else, over signed HTTPS events.</p>
            <p class="num mt-3 text-xs text-muted-foreground">Developer</p>
        </a>
    </div>

    <div class="mx-auto mt-10 max-w-3xl">
        <CodeBlock Title="First call" Language="bash" Code="curl -X GET https://api.acme.co/v1/flags -H 'Authorization: Bearer $ACME_KEY'" />
    </div>
</div>
